@* A self-contained "How to read the Summa" helper. Renders a floating circular button that stacks
   above the back-to-top control, plus a native <dialog>, so it is reachable on the Summa home and on
   every question page (covering shared links). It explains the classic article structure and the
   meaning of the project name. *@

<FloatingGuide Title="How to read the Summa" Eyebrow="A short orientation"
               AriaLabel="How to read the Summa">
    <Icon>
